  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0626_T29_00000",
      "en_US": "GYARADOS: Gyashaa!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0626_T29_00001",
      "en_US": "DRAGONITE: Gyafooha!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0626_T29_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "That red GYARADOS wasn’t acting right.\n",
        "As I feared, somebody must have forced\f",
        "it to evolve...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0626_T29_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Did you come here because of the\n",
        "wild tales?\r",
        "You’re {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\n",
        "I’m Lance, a Trainer like you.\r",
        "I heard some rumblings, so I came to\n",
        "investigate...\r",
        "I saw the way you battled earlier,\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\r",
        "I can tell that you’re a Trainer\n",
        "with considerable skill.\r",
        "If you don’t mind, could you help me\n",
        "investigate? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0626_T29_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Did you come here because of the\n",
        "wild tales?\r",
        "You’re {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\n",
        "I’m Lance, a Trainer like you.\r",
        "I heard some rumblings, so I came to\n",
        "investigate...\r",
        "I saw the way you battled earlier,\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\r",
        "I can tell that you’re a Trainer\n",
        "with considerable skill.\r",
        "If you don’t mind, could you help me\n",
        "investigate? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0626_T29_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Lance: Excellent!\r",
        "It seems that the Lake of Rage’s\n",
        "MAGIKARP are being forced to evolve.\r",
        "A mysterious radio broadcast coming\n",
        "from Mahogany is probably the cause.\r",
        "And that suspicious souvenir shop...\r",
        "I’ll be waiting for you in Mahogany,\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0626_T29_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Lance: Excellent!\r",
        "It seems that the Lake of Rage’s\n",
        "MAGIKARP are being forced\f",
        "to evolve.\r",
        "A mysterious radio broadcast coming\n",
        "from Mahogany is the cause.\r",
        "I’ll be waiting for you, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0626_T29_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh... Well, if you change your mind,\n",
        "please help me."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0626_T29_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Lance: What do you think?\n",
        "Are you going to help me? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0626_T29_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "The GYARADOS are angry!\n",
        "It’s a bad omen!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0626_T29_00010",
      "en_US": "Hahah! The MAGIKARP are biting!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0626_T29_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "I heard this lake was made by rampaging\n",
        "GYARADOS.\r",
        "I wonder if there is any connection\n",
        "to their mass outbreak now?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0626_T29_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "Did my eyes deceive me? I saw a \n",
        "red GYARADOS in the Lake of Rage...\r",
        "But I thought GYARADOS were\n",
        "usually blue?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0626_T29_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "Pryce: The strong rain falling on the\n",
        "surface seems to be agitating the\f",
        "raging lake.\r",
        "This must have some purpose that we\n",
        "meet again.\r",
        "Why don’t we exchange our phone\n",
        "numbers? {YESNO 0}\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0626_T29_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} registered Pryce\n",
        "in the Pokégear!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0626_T29_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "Pryce: I make it a habit to train myself\n",
        "on Monday mornings to give this lazy\f",
        "body a spine.\r",
        "You could be a good training partner.\n",
        "I’ll be waiting for your call!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0626_T29_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "Pryce: That’s OK, too.\n",
        "People ought to have their own ideas.\f",
        "That’s the way it is."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0626_T29_00017",
      "en_US": [
        "Pryce: So? Will you exchange\n",
        "numbers with me? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0626_T29_00018",
      "en_US": [
        "Battle with the great catch\n",
        "I just got!"
      ]
    },
